untries and sustain elimination in countries that have achieved it\"},\n     {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"This report summarizes progress toward achieving MNT elimination during 2000–2018.\"}\n   ]},\n   {\"v\": \"before/after or trend\", \"ev\": [\n     {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"During 2000–2018, the number of reported NT cases worldwide (i.e., including nonpriority countries) decreased by 90%\"}\n   ]}\n ],\n \"methods_quotes\": [\n   {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"NT deaths are usually estimated using mathematical models\"},\n   {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"WHO and UNICEF estimate the percentage of births attended by an SBA from health facility reports and coverage survey estimates shared by countries\"},\n   {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"had missing TT2+/Td2+ coverage data for the year 2000 or 2018\"}\n ],\n \"confidence\": \"medium\",\n \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}\n```", "type": "text"}]}